flowchart LR
    A[/proc/pid/cgroup] -->|read on first event per pid| CR[ContainerResolver]
    B[fork/clone events] --> PT[ProcessTree]
    PT -->|resolve ppid + parent_comm| EX[exec events]
    C[FIM baseline] -->|hash + metadata| FW[FimWatcher]
    D[connection history] --> BC[BeaconingTracker]
    D --> CT[ConnectionTracker]

    CR --> NE[NormalizedEvent]
    EX --> NE
    FW --> NE
    BC --> NE
    CT --> NE

    NE --> RE[Rules Engine]
    RE -->|tags: rule:id, severity-based logs| SINKS[Output Sinks]
    SINKS --> STDOUT[stdout]
    SINKS --> JSONFILE[events.jsonl]
    SINKS --> LOGFILE[events.log]